{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And it came to pass, when humankind began to multiply on the face of the earth</b> — Since Scripture has mentioned Noah and his sons and intends to begin the matter of the Flood, it states that immediately when the children of humankind began to multiply they began to sin, and they persisted in their sin for many days until Noah was four hundred and eighty years old, and then the Holy One, blessed be He, decreed upon them that His spirit would not abide in them forever, but would yet prolong days for them until their measure was filled, for such is the way of Elohim."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:25:00.973115321Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}